          "character_offset": 74760,
          "byte_offset_utf8": 86197
        },
        "quote": "每次进入此模式获得1层攻击力+0%的增益（最多叠加999层）"
      },
      {
        "source": {
          "file": ".cache/p3-310-boss-research/cube-complete.html",
          "revision": "436997",
          "sha256": "f7baaa02f9ea23720296d9fdb3ec6286746b54473a70f9082f08ff27c7565a5c",
          "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/源阶方?oldid=436997"
        },
        "source_selector": ".ak-card__body.skill_card[6]",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "location": {
          "line": 560,
          "column": 409,
          "character_offset": 74760,
          "byte_offset_utf8": 86197
        },
        "quote": "使全场范围内的所有我方单位（无视目标可选性，不受迷彩制约）获得【源阶方污染】：每秒受到0无来源真实伤害（同名效果不叠加）"
      }
    ],
    "nearby_tooltips": [
      {
        "location": {
          "line": 560,
          "column": 599,
          "character_offset": 74950,
          "byte_offset_utf8": 86437
        },
        "text_including_nested_tooltips": "异常效果：自缚\n无法移动\n※效果与束缚相同，但不会被识别为束缚",
        "attributes": {
          "style": "display:none",
          "data-size": "350",
          "data-interactive": "true",
          "data-append-to": "body"
        }
      },
      {
        "location": {
          "line": 560,
          "column": 905,
          "character_offset": 75256,
          "byte_offset_utf8": 86819
        },
        "text_including_nested_tooltips": "异常效果：不可阻挡\n无法阻挡/被阻挡，自动解除阻挡",
        "attributes": {
          "style": "display:none",
          "data-size": "350",
          "data-interactive": "true",
          "data-append-to": "body"
        }
      },
      {
        "location": {
          "line": 560,
          "column": 1188,
          "character_offset": 75539,
          "byte_offset_utf8": 87166
        },
        "text_including_nested_tooltips": "异常效果：失衡免疫\n不会被位移影响，状态机无法切换至UNBALANCE\n※“失衡”并非异常效果，此效果也并非其异常免疫",
        "attributes": {
          "style": "display:none",
          "data-size": "350",
          "data-interactive": "true",
          "data-append-to": "body"
        }
      },
      {
        "location": {
          "line": 560,
          "column": 1490,
          "character_offset": 75841,
          "byte_offset_utf8": 87582
        },
        "text_including_nested_tooltips": "异常效果组合：沉睡\n这是一个异常组合，包含了以下异常效果\n无法行动+无敌+不可阻挡\n沉睡免疫：使自身的沉睡失效，但不会清除相关Buff",
        "attributes": {
          "style": "display:none",
          "data-size": "350",
          "data-interactive": "true",
          "data-append-to": "body"
        }
      },
      {
        "location": {
          "line": 560,
          "column": 2238,
          "character_offset": 76589,
          "byte_offset_utf8": 88636
        },
        "text_including_nested_tooltips": "异常效果：无敌\n无法被不同阵营选中（属于无法选择类效果）；受到的伤害与元素值变为0；\n无法触发任何单位未绑定选择器的能力\n※可影响沉睡单位的伤害在特定情况下可以无视无敌的免伤效果",
        "attributes": {
          "style": "display:none",
          "data-size": "350",
          "data-interactive": "true",
          "data-append-to": "body"
        }
      },
      {
        "location": {
          "line": 560,
          "column": 2791,
          "character_offset": 77142,
          "byte_offset_utf8": 89483
        },
        "text_including_nested_tooltips": "异常效果：迷彩\n无法被对立阵营的部分能力和部分弹道选中；会因隐匿免疫而失效，但在因隐匿免疫而失效的情况下依旧能被检测到\n※由特殊逻辑实现，不属于“无法选择”效果\n※所有光环类能力、以及涉及中点判定/格子判定的效果均不受迷彩制约，但存在主动排除受迷彩影响单位的情况（此时站内会特别标注）\n※迷彩与“阻挡时解除”没有直接关系，该机制通常由其他效果实现",
        "attributes": {
          "style": "display:none",
          "data-size": "350",
          "data-interactive": "true",
          "data-append-to": "body"
        }
      }
    ],
